Package: ghs20x
Title: Global Health Spending 20x Analysis (GHED 2000-2023)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Song", family = "Zhuang", email = "2711944586@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: End-to-end analysis, visualisation and deployment of the WHO Global
    Health Expenditure Database (GHED) for the TidyTuesday 2026-04-21 dataset.
    Covers 195 countries over 2000-2023 with 300 static figures, 133 interactive
    widgets, 81 statistical models, and a 36-module Shiny dashboard. Includes
    data engineering pipeline, GitHub Actions deployment, and quality gates.
    Author: 庄颂 (20241334).
